"text\", \"q\": \"Data were analyzed as a matched case-control study, and a multivariable logistic analysis was conducted to control for confounding from coexposures.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"For each case-patient household, one to three geographically matched control households were recruited using a reverse--digit-dialing system.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Case-patient and control households were excluded from analysis where questions were not answered.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}